                "backgroundColor": "transparent",
                "fontColor": "#cbd5e1",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "customFontSize": 12,
                "markdown": "Count of active SGT assignments observed in the selected time window from Cisco ISE authentication syslog, reflecting the number of distinct user/device classifications where a non\\-default Security Group Tag was assigned\\."
            }
